# APR finder keeps the best (most straw hits) of up to 3 helix candidates per search instead
# of the first; a candidate with >= 20 straw hits is saved at once. Needs the Offline
# AgnosticHelixFinder options maxHelixCandidates / acceptHelixStrawHits (Offline branch
# apr-helix-finding). Part of the 2026-10-14 re-tuned APR finder; prerequisite of apr_tgtrep100.
physics.producers.TrigAprHelixFinder.maxHelixCandidates : 3
physics.producers.TrigAprHelixFinder.acceptHelixStrawHits : 20
